data: {"id": "5046832526c746ef-thinking-parallel_evidence-876", "run_id": "5046832526c746ef", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好，基于 baseline 结果：\n- **Metrics**: `coverage=present` - 确认 pod 处于 `Pending` phase，container `app` 处于 `waiting` 且 `reason=\"ImagePullBackOff\"`。重启次数 0。\n- **Logging**: `coverage=empty` - 由于 pod 从未成功启动，无应用日志。合理。\n- **Tracing**: `coverage=empty` - 虽然 pod 有 IP (172.16.104.28)，但无 L7 flow 数据。合理。\n\n接下来需要执行剩余的 Kubernetes 诊断步骤（describe, events, yaml），以获取 ImagePullBackOff 的具体原因（如 manifest unknown, connection refused, unauthorized 等）。\n\n执行 `kubectl_describe`, `kubectl_events`, `kubectl_get_yaml`。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789352696062, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

