data: {"id": "5046832526c746ef-thinking-parallel_evidence-1309", "run_id": "5046832526c746ef", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "所有必要工具已执行完毕，证据已完整。以下是采集到的事实、冲突和缺口：\n\n### 采集事实\n1. **生命周期状态确认**：Pod `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-jmq6b` 当前持续处于 `Pending` phase。Container `app` 的状态为 `Waiting`，原因 `ImagePullBackOff`。重启次数为 0。\n2. **核心事件证据 (Root Cause)**：Kubernetes Events 和 Describe 均返回确切的拉取失败错误：\n   `failed to resolve reference \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\": failed to do request: Head \"https://registry.invalid/v2/aiops/workload/manifests/missing\": dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host`\n3. **配", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789352702952, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

